                    {
                        "id": "ac4627b7-72ce-450e-b978-cc59dba49005",
                        "fragments_version": "0.01",
                        "instruction": null,
                        "cot_trigger": "zhou-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Step 1: Identify the symptoms and possible condition\n- High grade fever\n- Inspiratory stridor\n- Swallowing difficulty\n- Drooling of saliva\n\nThese symptoms suggest a possible upper airway obstruction, such as croup, epiglottitis, or bacterial tracheitis.\n\nStep 2: Evaluate the treatment options\nA) Nebulized racemic epinephrine: This is used to treat croup, which is characterized by a barking cough, stridor, and respiratory distress. However, the presence of high-grade fever and drooling of saliva are not typical for croup.\n\nB) Anti-diphtheria toxin: This is used to treat diphtheria, which presents with a sore throat, fever, and a thick gray membrane covering the throat. The symptoms described do not match diphtheria.\n\nC) Corticosteroids: These can be used to treat croup and may also be beneficial in other upper airway obstructions. However, they may not be the primary treatment for the condition described.\n\nD) IV ceftriaxone: This is a broad-spectrum antibiotic used to treat bacterial infections, including epiglottitis and bacterial tracheitis. The symptoms described are more consistent with epiglottitis, which is a medical emergency requiring immediate treatment with antibiotics.\n\nStep 3: Choose the best treatment option\nBased on the symptoms and the treatment options, the best treatment for this child is IV ceftriaxone (option D). However, it is important to note that general airway management and other supportive measures should also be provided.",
                        "answers": [
                            {
                                "id": "e1de8caa-090e-448f-aa29-e26d485cd4cb",
                                "answer_extraction": "kojima-A-D",
