                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n1. The drug is taken in.\n2. It is absorbed in the intestine.\n3. It is metabolized in the liver.\n4. It is excreted from the kidney.\n5. It is absorbed in the intestine.\n6. It is metabolized in the liver.\n7. It is excreted from the kidney.\n8. It is absorbed in the intestine.\n9. It is metabolized in the liver.\n10. It is excreted from the kidney.\n\nSo, the answer is B) Intravenous.",
