                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n1. Glycine can be converted to Serine, which can be converted to Orotic acid. Orotic acid can be converted to Citric acid. Citric acid can be converted to Isocitric acid. Isocitric acid can be converted to Oxalosuccinic acid. Oxalosuccinic acid can be converted to \u03b1-Ketoglutarate. \u03b1-Ketoglutarate can be converted to Succinyl-CoA. Succinyl-CoA can be converted to Acetyl-CoA.\n2. Tyrosine can be converted to Succinyl-CoA. Succinyl-CoA can be converted to Acetyl-CoA.\n3. Hydroxyprolinc can be converted to Succinyl-CoA. Succinyl-CoA can be converted to Acetyl-CoA.\n4. Alanine can be converted to Glutamate. Glutamate can be converted to \u03b1-Ketoglutarate. \u03b1-Ketoglutarate can be converted to Succinyl-CoA. Succinyl-CoA can be converted to Acetyl-CoA.",
