                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "we need to understand that only amino acids that can be converted into pyruvate or acetyl-CoA can enter the Krebs cycle. Glycine, alanine, and hydroxyproline can be converted into pyruvate, while tyrosine can be converted into acetyl-CoA. Therefore, the answer is B) Tyrosine.",
                        "answers": [
