                        "cot_trigger": "lievin-01",
                        "cot_trigger_template": "",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "Let's derive the differential diagnosis step by step: \n\n1. To evaluate post-operative vision effects after cataract extraction surgery under PCB, we need to use a method of surveillance.\n2. There are four types of surveillance: active, sentinel, passive, and routine checkup of all operated cases.\n3. We are looking for a method of surveillance that is used to evaluate post-operative vision effects after cataract extraction surgery under PCB.\n4. The method of surveillance that is used to evaluate post-operative vision effects after cataract extraction surgery under PCB is passive surveillance.",
                        "answers": [
