                        "cot_trigger": null,
                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nC) Check for response and call help. \n\nThe first step in any medical emergency is to assess the patient's level of consciousness and call for appropriate help. In this case, the patient is unresponsive, so the first step would be to check for any response and call for emergency medical services. Once help is on the way, further assessment and treatment can be initiated.",
                        "answers": [
