                        "cot": "\n\nSeasonal: This refers to a pattern of change that occurs at regular intervals, usually related to the seasons.\n\nCyclical: This refers to a pattern of change that occurs in a repeating cycle.\n\nPeriodical: This refers to a pattern of change that occurs at regular intervals, usually over a long period of time.\n\nSecular: This refers to a pattern of change that occurs over a long period of time, usually decades or centuries.\n\nThe correct answer is D) Secular.",
