                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nD) The genealogy records of their family. \n\nEye color is determined by genetics, so looking at the eye color of the baby's parents, grandparents, and other relatives can give a good indication of what color the baby's eyes may be. However, it is important to note that eye color can be influenced by other factors such as lighting and age, and it is not always possible to accurately predict a baby's eye color.",
