                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nStep 1: What happens when you bang on a drum?\n- The drum produces sound waves.\n\nStep 2: What happens when sound waves reach our ears?\n- The sound waves cause our eardrums to vibrate.\n\nStep 3: What happens when our eardrums vibrate?\n- The vibrations are transmitted to the inner ear, where they are converted into electrical signals that are sent to the brain.\n\nStep 4: What do we perceive when our brain receives these electrical signals?\n- We perceive sound.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is C) reverberations to strike the eardrum.",
