                        "cot": " \n\nFirst, what are fossil fuels? \n\nFossil fuels are hydrocarbons, which are molecules that contain both nitrogen and chlorine. Hydrocarbons are formed when organic matter is subjected to high temperatures and pressures over millions of years. \n\nSo, the answer to the question is C) significant supplies accumulated prior.",
