                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "\n\nAn instinctual behavior is a behavior that is innate and not learned. \n\nA) Dogs rolling over on command is a learned behavior, not an instinctual one. \nB) Frogs returning to the ponds where they hatched to lay eggs is an instinctual behavior. \nC) Birds mimicking human speech is a learned behavior, not an instinctual one. \nD) Seals clapping for treats from trainers is a learned behavior, not an instinctual one. \n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B) frogs returning to the ponds where they hatched to lay eggs.",
