                        "cot_trigger_template": "{instruction}\n\n{question}\n{answer_choices}\n\n{cot_trigger}",
                        "prompt_text": "",
                        "cot": "it is important to understand what instinctual behavior means. Instinctual behavior refers to innate, automatic, and unlearned behaviors that are genetically programmed in an organism. Based on this definition, the correct answer is B) frogs returning to the ponds were they hatched to lay eggs. This behavior is genetically programmed in frogs and is essential for their survival and reproduction. The other options involve learned behaviors or behaviors that are trained by humans, which are not considered instinctual.",
